<title>BELGIUM: Auximines H1 1996 profit surges 114 pct.</title>
<headline>Auximines H1 1996 profit surges 114 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996 (in millions of Belgian francs unless stated):</p>
<p>    Group net profit		   297.9  vs  139.2</p>
<p>    Cons net profit		    967.6  vs  878.8</p>
<p>    Cons dividend income	     510.6  vs  453.2</p>
<p>Cons extraordinary gains/loss  534.3  vs  290.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Auximines is a Belgian holding company. In a statement, the company said it expected full year 1996 results to grow and to pay a higher dividend.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
